contentText:
BMI celebrated the songwriters and publishers behind 25 of its most-performing Christian music songs over the past year, during a celebration held at BMI&#8217;s Nashville office on Wednesday (July 22).

&#8220;Made For More,&#8221; written by Jessie Early, Jonathan Smith and Blake Wiggins, was named BMI&#8217;s Christian song of the year. The hit, recorded by Josh Baldwin, was Baldwin&#8217;s first No. 1 on Billboard&#8217;s Christian AC Airplay chart.

